PROSE SUMMARY (context, not a substitute for the structured log above)
---------------------------------------------------------------------
Short 12-turn game. Slowpoke built a wide Antique Mirror engine for card draw while deploying Elphidran/Elphidran Aqua/Relaxaurus/Pengullet threats. Several of Slowpoke's attacks were nullified by Charcola's Pyrin Noct/Cryolinx interrupts (turns 5, 8, 11), but Slowpoke's Elphidran (Dragon-buffed, 1100 power) destroyed Charcola's own Elphidran Aqua in return (turn 9). Slowpoke ground Charcola down steadily via Elphidran/Elphidran Aqua/Relaxaurus/Pengullet chip damage (10->8->5->3->1->0) across just 12 turns, closing with a final Pengullet hit for 2.


